<title>HONG KONG: Hopewell gains HK$3.96 bln in CEPA sale.</title>
<headline>Hopewell gains HK$3.96 bln in CEPA sale.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hopewell Holdings said on Friday the sale of shares in its Consolidated Electric Power Asia Ltd (CEPA) would generate an expectional gain of HK$3.96 billion.</p>
